ary School Fictional-03</span></h2><span data-testid="s7-tested" class="flex"><span data-num="12" data-den="5" data-win="egra-2026-09-28" data-grader="egra-coach-tablet-v2" class="text-[13px] leading-[1.45] text-cp-ink-3">12 children tested</span></span><ul data-testid="s7-rows" class="flex flex-col divide-y divide-cp-hairline border-t border-cp-hairline"><li data-w="W-LS" data-status="ok" class="flex flex-col gap-0.5 py-3"><span data-num="7" data-den="12" data-win="egra-2026-09-28" data-grader="egra-coach-tablet-v2" class="text-[22px] font-extrabold leading-[1.1] tracking-[-0.01em] text-cp-navy">7 of 12</span><span class="text-[15px] font-semibold leading-snug text-cp-ink">Letter sounds low</span><span class="text-[15px] leading-[1.45] text-cp-ink-2">children tested could not give the sound of most letters.</span></li><li data-w="W-LN" data-status="ok" class="flex flex-col gap-0.5 py-3"><span data-num="5" data-den="12" data-win="egra-2026-09-28" data-grader="egra-coach-tablet-v2" class="text-[22px] font-extrabold leading-[1.1] tracking-[-0.01em] text-cp-navy">5 of 12</span><span class="text-[15px] font-semibold leading-snug text-cp-ink">Letter names low</span><span class="text-[15px] leading-[1.45] text-cp-ink-2">children tested could not give the name of most letters.</span></li><li data-w="W-FW" data-status="not_measured" class="flex flex-col gap-0.5 py-3"><span class="text-[15px] font-semibold leading-snug text-cp-ink">Familiar words low</span><span data-pill="not-yet" class="inline-block rounded-full px-3 py-[5px] text-[12px] font-semibold leading-[1.4] bg-cp-navy-tint text-cp-ink-2 w-fit">not measured yet</span></li></ul><a data-testid="s7-send" class="cp-press flex min-h-[44px] items-center justify-center rounded-[12px] border-2 border-cp-navy bg-white px-4 py-2.5 text-center text-[14px] font-semibold leading-snug text-cp-navy outline-none [overflow-wrap:anywhere] focus-visible:ring-[3px] focus-visible:ring-cp-navy focus-visible:ring-offset-2" href="/portal/f